OL,3,GNEWSACalls for more to be made of
OL,4,Asubsidised Paris air link
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore could be done to attract visitors
OL,7,Fto Guernsey through its direct flight
OL,8,Fto Paris, according to the president of
OL,9,Fthe island's hospitality association.
OL,11,FThe route, operated by Aurigny under a
OL,12,FStates-backed agreement, has received
OL,13,Fits full subsidy in 2024 and 2025 after
OL,14,Ffailing to meet revenue targets.
OL,16,FThe Committee for Economic Development
OL,17,Fsaid the service had brought more than
OL,18,F2,000 visitors to the island and
OL,19,Fgenerated an estimated #1.4m in visitor
OL,20,Fspending.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
