OL,3,GNEWSACalls for more to be made of
OL,4,Asubsidised Paris air link
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Hospitality Association
OL,7,Fpresident Alan Sillett said flights
OL,8,Fwere at about 60% capacity, giving
OL,9,Fscope for significant growth.
